# The AI players of the roster, one entity of keys each, in the map list format.
#
# name        The AI player's name (required).
# skin        The player model and skin, such as enforcer/default (required).
# guid        The stable UUID by which stats track the AI player.
# skill       0 to 1: aim, turn speed and reaction time (required).
# aggression  0 to 1: retreat, chase and combat style (required).
# awareness   0 to 1: item range and weapon choice (required).
# color       The effect hue, 0 to 360. Unset, it is random.
# helmet      The helmet tint, as six hex digits. Unset, it is random.
# shirt       The shirt tint, as six hex digits. Unset, it is random.
# pants       The pants tint, as six hex digits. Unset, it is random.

